    option_c: 'Allow Kim to continue personal trading but require 48-hour pre-disclosure of all personal trades to Mehta for approval, implement a policy requiring employees to execute personal trades at the same time as client accounts on a last-in-line basis, and restructure Kim\'s compensation to include clawback provisions if personal trading appears to disadvantage clients',
